ot a world Noble from  marijua which makes the people think  that she will bring about real change  change and yet the one who really wields  all the power behind the scenes would be  the same as before the one who sits on  the empty Throne imusama if imusama  really had all of this planned out it  would be some of the most Machiavellian  stuff I've ever seen in the anime not  only is imusama controlling one ruling  regime from behind the scenes but he or  she is already making preparations to  control the next regime once this one is  overthrown imusama will simply replace  one puppet regime with another and  everyone will be happy because they will  think that actual change has occurred as  a result of all their hard work and  sacrifice in reality only the facade  will have been changed and the core  structure will remain the same and not  only is this possible but something  similar may already have occurred in the  past we now know that before marijua  even existed the red line was inhabited  by a race of god-like creatures known as  the lunarians just like the celestial  dragons they were not actual Gods but  they were a very powerful race with  Incredible abilities which is why they  were treated like Gods by others they  had large black wings which allowed them  to fly they had the ability to generate  and manipulate fire and they had  superhuman physical resilience and yet  this race of overpowered people is now  practically extinct with King being the  only known Survivor it is quite likely  that the lunarians were defeated during  the void century and that their place as  Gods who live Atop The Red Line was  usurped by the celestial dragons the  lunarians were the original Celestial  dragons the original gods of the red  line and the current Celestial dragons  are just Pretenders to the throne the  current Celestial dragons were put into  Power by imusama in order to maintain  stability in the world by creating a new  system that was somewhat similar to the  old one with an elite group of so-called  Divine beings rule ruling over the world  from Atop The Red Line but the new  system concentrated all the real power  in imusama and the celestial dragons  themselves are just puppets we know that  even today at least 800 or 900 years  after the fall of the lunarians the  world government still hunts them down  and offers cash rewards for any  information that could lead to capturing  a lunarian which is likely one of the  reasons why the lunarians are  practically extinct because of this I  believe it's possible that imusama  already orchestrated one massive regime  change in the past back when the  lunarians were overthrown and replaced  by the celestial dragons and imusama  could be planning to do something  similar in the future once the time is  right in fact it is possible that the  original Joy boy himself was a lunarian  and that the capital of the ancient  kingdom was actually up top the red line  it might have even been located where  marijua is now and marijua was only  Built there there in order to cover up  the ruins of the ancient Kingdom we know  that the world government has been  actively hunting the lunarians for  centuries which suggests that they  clearly see the lunarians as a massive  threat and one other thing that they've  been hunting for centuries is the Nika  devil fruit if the original Joy boy was  a lunarian who also possessed the Nika  devil fruit this would explain why he  was such a huge threat to the world  government he would have been incredibly  overpowered and this could be why the  world government is so obsessed with  hunting down both the lunarians and  Anika devil fruit they might have  believed that Joy boy would one day  return as a lunarian so along with  hunting the Nika devil fruit they also  decided to hunt every lunarian just to  cover all their bases essentially by  trying to locate every lunarian and the  Nika devil fruit at the same time they  were actively trying to prevent the  prophesized return of Joy boy but now  that Joy boy has returned turned in the  form of Luffy another Machiavellian  regime change may be in order courtesy  of imusama the rulers of the world who  live Atop The Red Line may be replaced  yet again but the true power behind the  scenes will remain in the hands of the  same person this being a Shonen we can  assume that Luffy and the Gang will find  a way to foil this plan at the end and  before I end this video I do want to  address a really interesting comment I  got on my video about the void Century a  commenter named Crest suggested that the  d-clan may actually be descendants of  the real dragons the ones who ruled Atop  The Red Line before they were replaced  by the current regime so the D might  actually stand for Dragon the true  dragon and this is why the d-clan are  natural enemies of the so-called gods in  marijua members of the d-clan are the  natural enemies of the celestial dragons  because they are the rightful rulers of  the world and the Celestial Dragon are  just usurpers this is definitely a  fascinating idea although we don't yet  have a direct connection between the  d-clan and the lunarians the members of  the d-clan certainly don't have the  genetic features that are associated  with lunarians so if the lunarians  really were the original Celestial  dragons then there has to be some  explanation for why the d-clan would  inherit this title despite not being  descended from lunarians and if this  were the case and if the D really did  stand for Dragon then Luffy's dad's name  would be monkey dragon dragon which is  kind of weird but hey who knows either  way I really like this idea of imusama  using the obnoxious Goofy and extremely  punchable World Nobles as nothing more  than Expendable puppets in a grand  master plan and I also like the notion  that the d-clan may be the only ones who  are capable of exposing the real truth  about imusama we do still need a  connection between the ancient Kingdom  the lunarians and the a d-clan but with  the way that the manga is going that  connection could be revealed at any  moment and of course if it is one they  confirm that the original Joy boy was a  lunarian and that the capital of the  ancient kingdom was located on top of  the red line then that will put us very  close to finally deciphering all of the  Mysteries in one piece definitely let me  know what you guys think was Joy Boy the  original Joy boy actually a lunarian and  are the celestial dragons just usurping  the position of the true Celestial  dragons the lunarians is imusama  planning to sacrifice the world Nobles  as part of a grand plan to remain in  power while making everyone think that  the old regime has been overthrown and  is imusama planning on using Vivi as the  new face of the world government don't  forget to leave your thoughts down in  the comments below if you guys enjoyed  this video and you want to see more  one-piece content right here on the  channel leave a quick like and comment  it only takes a second but it really  helps with that YouTube algorithm and of  course subscribing and hitting that  notification Bell is a completely free  but very real way of directly supporting  the channel you can also hit me up on  Twitter and Instagram at anime uproar as  always thank you guys so much for  watching and until next time see ya  Space Cowboys

